==Description==
'''Mischievous Grinchy''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from [[The Final Act Event]]. It was obtained from Level 29 of the premium track, which had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|990}} or {{Robux|133}} ({{Robux|106}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|13,095}} or {{Robux|2,855}} ({{Robux|2,272}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Mischievous Grinchy''' showcases the {{Color|FinalAct|Grinch}} [[Turret]] skin rubbing its hand while having a mischievous expression on its face.

==Trivia==
*This sticker is based on the [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/rubbing-hands-emoji rubbing hands emoji] meme.

